          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In 2019, Fitness Superstore developed French Fitness, its own brand of gym equipment and currently stands as its exclusive dealer. French Fitness offers everything you need for a commercial or home gym– from gym flooring to treadmills, ellipticals, exercise bikes, steppers, stair mills, rowers, air bikes, and strength training equipment including cross training equipment, rack and rig systems, selectorized equipment, plate loaded equipment, free weights, benches, multi functional equipment, gym accessories and attachments, plyo and speed training, and more.</p><p>French Fitness prides themselves for delivering industry-standard quality, excellent customer service, extensive warranties (10 year parts, 1 year labor), with all products assembled in the USA.</p>",
